00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:25.210
that your thing is guaranteed to not be vulnerable to cross-site scripting.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:28.875
And if your thing compiles then the headers must be inserted on every request,

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:32.180
and you can't possibly- you couldn't have possibly gotten it wrong because Rocket will do

