00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:42.660
[NOISE] Um, so I want to just quickly show you sort of

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:48.130
what authentication and authorization looks like in- in this in this Rails application.

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:51.595
You sort of saw what we would do in Rocket by having an admin type,

00:18:51.595 --> 00:18:54.119
that automatic authenticate and autho- and authorizes,

00:18:54.119 --> 00:18:57.160
uh, if you would do this in something like Rails  it looks very, very different.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:00.395
Um, this is the attack by the way, uh, you log in,

00:19:00.395 --> 00:19:02.270
you get an authenticity token,

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.130
you then send a request, and that's it.

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:07.195
That's literally the entire attack.

00:19:07.195 --> 00:19:09.180
So, it's a very, very, very simple attack.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.830
You just need to grab a cookie from your browser,

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.980
and then send a HTTP request with those parameters filled in,

00:19:15.980 --> 00:19:18.400
and then you're whoever you want to be, you're that username.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:21.475
[NOISE] Okay. This is the code that sort of led to that.

00:19:21.475 --> 00:19:22.810
Don't worry about most of it.

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.345
Worry about this little part here.

00:19:24.345 --> 00:19:27.910
So, this is what actually does the authorization authentication.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:31.530
This authorized the impersonator to sort of hopefully does what you expect,

00:19:31.530 --> 00:19:34.640
it checks the session and it tries to find that user,

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.650
and it checks if that user is an administrator.

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:42.390
[NOISE] Um, in this impersonation controller thing they have this before action.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:46.075
This is something it's supposed to execute before anything else executes.

00:19:46.075 --> 00:19:49.450
So, they say before action authorize the impersonator.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.200
Okay. But they also have a skip before action which

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.325
has under certain conditions don't do these things.

00:19:55.325 --> 00:19:56.910
So, skip before action,

00:19:56.910 --> 00:19:59.115
do not authenticate the administrator,

00:19:59.115 --> 00:20:00.830
if you're doing it destroy.

