00:23:38.900 --> 00:23:42.830
So, Dynamic Paths are those things in brackets at the top there,

00:23:42.830 --> 00:23:44.395
at the top of the route.

00:23:44.395 --> 00:23:49.705
And parameters and brackets will match any text that's applied in that URL segment.

